      title: 'Input X — receptive field',
      tooltip: 'Drag to move the 3×3 window',
      body: 'The shaded 3×3 block is the receptive field of the hidden unit currently being computed. Drag it across X: the highlighted output cell follows, one scalar per spatial position.'
